diate"><addressbook><name>FUJIWARA, SHUICHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SEIKO EPSON CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>AKAIWA SHOICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJIWARA SHUICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AKAIWA, SHOICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJIWARA, SHUICHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>The keystone distortion of a projected picture occurring when the picture is projected obliquely onto the screen is reduced. Picture data outputted from an on-screen display (OSD) menu creating unit (4) and projection picture data supplied from a picture source through a video signal input unit (1) and a graphics signal input unit (2) are combined by a synthesizing circuit (3), and synthesized picture data is corrected by a keystone distortion correcting unit (5).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention permet de réduire la distorsion trapézoïdale d'une image projetée, qui se produit lorsque l'image est projetée obliquement sur l'écran. A cet effet, les données d'images émises par une unité de création de menus d'affichage sur écran (OSD) (4) et les données d'images de projection fournies par une source d'images via une unité d'entrée de signal vidéo (1) et une unité d'entrée de signal graphique (2) sont combinées par un circuit synthétiseur (3) et les données d'images ainsi synthétisées sont corrigées par une unité de correction de distorsion trapézoïdale (5).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>